+        Bits: {local_x + ly * cluster_m : ly in 0..cluster_n-1}
+    B mask: WGs sharing the same N-tile column (same local_y, varying local_x).
+        Bits: {lx + local_y * cluster_m : lx in 0..cluster_m-1}
