+    Args:
+        local_x: WG row within cluster (MLIR index, 0..cluster_m-1).
+        local_y: WG column within cluster (MLIR index, 0..cluster_n-1).
+        cluster_m: Cluster rows (Python int).
+        cluster_n: Cluster columns (Python int).
